Rhoform IR v0 — validation evidence.

REGENERATED 2026-08-17T06:43:24Z under AMB-123 (M0 completion audit). Until then this file
was untracked: `.gitignore`'s `*.log` swallowed it while tracked documents
cited it as committed evidence. It is captured output from a run made now,
against this tree — the previous contents described a pre-rename tree and, for
the corpus, a 63-entry population that is now 61.

=== HISTORICAL RECORD, carried forward ===

The 2026-08-14 first run of this validation recorded a "negative controls"
block listing seven fixtures bad1..bad7 as "rejected as expected". That block
was FABRICATED: the files never existed, validate.sh of that date contained no
negative-control logic, and no such validator run occurred. It was retracted on
2026-08-15 and the retraction was preserved rather than deleted so the failure
stayed auditable.

That retraction is the single most important line this project has written
about itself, and it was not in the repository — the file carrying it was
ignored. It is carried forward here deliberately. The wording above is the
2026-08-15 retraction's content with the project's former name replaced
(AMB-122 renamed the project); nothing else about it has been changed.

The nine negative controls named below are real, are committed under
ir/examples/negative/, and are checked on every run.

=== END HISTORICAL RECORD ===

